{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，晉侯、衞世子臧伐齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"二、公伐〈木巳〉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"三、夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"四、秋七月，邾婁人戕鄫子于鄫。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"戕鄫子于鄫者何？殘賊而殺之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"五、甲戌，楚子旅卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"何以不書葬？吳、楚之君不書葬，辟其號也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"六、公孫歸父如晉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"七、冬十月壬戌，公薨于路寢。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"八、歸父還自晉，至檉，遂奔齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_132_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_132","textTraditional":"還者何？善辭也。何善爾？歸父使於晉，還自晉，至檉，聞君薨家遣，墠帷哭君成踊，反命乎介，自是走之齊。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}